            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "ANCHEER pads can be acceptable for slow walking at a low price, but ANCHEER has no working treadmill website, its listings contradict themselves on motor and capacity, and support runs through Amazon. Buy from a listing sold by Amazon.com and plan on the lowest published figures.",
