        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Where can I find an ANCHEER treadmill manual?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Check the Product guides and documents section of the Amazon listing from your order, note the model number and FCC ID from the label on the machine, then look for a copy on third-party manual archives filed under the ASIN or model number. You can also ask the seller for the manual through your Amazon order.",
