            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "The TR6056 listing offers a one-year manufacturer warranty, but we found no published ANCHEER warranty document. In practice, the Amazon return window is your first protection, and warranty claims go through the seller via your Amazon order.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Has ANCHEER had a recall?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Not for treadmills. The CPSC recalled about 22,000 ANCHEER e-bikes, model AM001907, in October 2022 because their batteries could ignite. We found no recall of any ANCHEER treadmill or walking pad when we searched on 5 November 2026.",
          },
